BAGSHAW PUBLIC 5-RANK CANDIDATE CENSUS -- 2026-08-24
====================================================

STATUS: FINITE-COMPUTED / GRH-ASSISTED DISCOVERY over the 131199 rows in the
public D.txt at repository commit c4247d7.  PARI's quadclassunit supplied the
full invariant-factor histogram, and bnfcertify was not run on every row.
The explicit rank-four subgroup emitted at the maximum is independently
VERIFIED EXACT by Gauss composition.  This is a census of one structured
candidate bank, not a search over all fundamental discriminants and not a
nonexistence result.

Source:

  https://github.com/ChristianBagshaw/quadratic-fields-high-n-rank

Command (GP is a locally extracted PARI/GP 2.13.3 binary):

  python3 04-computation/imaginary_quadratic_class_rank_certificate_tool_20260824.py \
    search --pari-gp /tmp/oct-class-tools-20260824/root/usr/bin/gp \
    --ell 5 --target-rank 6 \
    --candidates-file <(sed 's/^-//' \
      /tmp/oct-class-sources-20260824/quadratic-fields-high-n-rank/data/D.txt)

